{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QrB3HI3rF91794211566.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天文台今早錄得氣溫23.2度，是入秋以來最低，預測晚上市區氣溫進一步下降，明早最低約16度。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205313-%E5%A4%A9%E6%B0%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%96%87%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%99%E6%99%9A%E4%B8%8A%E5%B8%82%E5%8D%80%E6%B0%A3%E6%BA%AB%E9%80%B2%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E4%B8%8B%E9%99%8D%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A9%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E7%B4%8416%E5%BA%A6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>天氣｜天文台料晚上市區氣溫進一步下降　明早最低約16度</strong></a></p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超聯同政府官員等，到立法會與全體立法會議員午宴。多名官員，包括律政司司長林定國、財政司司長陳茂波，多名局長、紀律部隊首長及行政會議成員亦有出席。立法會主席李慧琼致詞時指，午宴能讓議員及官員深入交流。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205342-%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E7%8E%87%E5%AE%98%E5%93%A1%E8%B5%B4%E7%AB%8B%E6%B3%95%E6%9C%83%E5%8D%88%E5%AE%B4%E8%88%87%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%B7%B1%E5%85%A5%E4%BA%A4%E6%B5%81\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>李家超率官員赴立法會午宴　與議員深入交流</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審，開始辯方案情，其中蔡天鳳的前大伯、鄺港傑出庭作供。他形容蔡天鳳愛面子，希望身邊家人看起來富裕。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205317-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E4%BD%9C%E4%BE%9B%E5%BD%A2%E5%AE%B9%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E6%84%9B%E9%9D%A2%E5%AD%90%E5%86%80%E8%BA%AB%E9%82%8A%E5%AE%B6%E4%BA%BA%E7%9C%8B%E8%B5%B7%E4%BE%86%E5%AF%8C%E8%A3%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港傑作供形容蔡天鳳愛面子　冀身邊家人看起來富裕</strong></a></p><p></p><p>政府推出過渡在職家庭津貼試驗計劃，綜援戶重投職場，三年最多可獲四萬五千元。在立法會福利事務委員會，有議員擔心金額未能協助他們過渡。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205315-%E6%9C%89%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%86%82%E9%81%8E%E6%B8%A1%E5%9C%A8%E8%81%B7%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD%E6%B4%A5%E8%B2%BC%E8%A9%A6%E9%A9%97%E8%A8%88%E5%8A%83%E9%87%91%E9%A1%8D%E6%9C%AA%E8%83%BD%E5%8D%94%E5%8A%A9%E7%B6%9C%E6%8F%B4%E6%88%B6%E9%81%8E%E6%B8%A1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>有議員憂過渡在職家庭津貼試驗計劃金額未能協助綜援戶過渡</strong></a></p><p></p><p>一輛城巴早上在北角英皇道撞倒一名過馬路的男途人，送院搶救後不治。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1205280-%E7%94%B7%E9%80%94%E4%BA%BA%E5%8C%97%E8%A7%92%E8%8B%B1%E7%9A%87%E9%81%93%E9%81%8E%E9%A6%AC%E8%B7%AF%E8%A2%AB%E5%9F%8E%E5%B7%B4%E6%92%9E%E5%80%92%E9%80%81%E9%99%A2%E6%90%B6%E6%95%91%E5%BE%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%B2%BB\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>男途人北角英皇道過馬路被城巴撞倒　送院搶救後不治</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.003076+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":467,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:14.465611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.096377+00:00","content_hash":"56ed96822dfde85842ef46d7686bc2619a5f13862c0eac19bdf3f7c422dde85d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.003076+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}